    imagery on its lid.
  artifactInspectionDescription: A masterwork Neolithic secondary burial jar discovered
    in Palawan. Incised curvilinear wave scrolls adorn the shoulders, and the lid
    features two souls sailing a bangka to the spirit realm.
  initialDialogue: what should i do
  plaqueDialogue: what could this artifact be
  artifactDialogue: i wonder what this artifact looks like
  promptText: '[E] Inspect Artifact'
  roomNumber: 11
